  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  subtitle: '- Dispenser Editor -'
  explanation: '- The <color=yellow>Dispenser Editor</color> lets you see and edit
    what a <color=yellow>Material Dispenser</color> will give to the player.


    -
    You can change the type of material dispensed in the <color=yellow>Type</color>
    dropdown.


    - You can change the number of material charge dispensed in the
    <color=yellow>Number</color> dropdown.


    - Once you have finished, simply
    click on <color=yellow>Accept</color> to validate your choice and close the editor.'
