--- !u!114 &861619659
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 861619655}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9047c8f07ad57ff43a0199efcc87e2ea, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  tooltipsPanel: {fileID: 635578615}
  subtitleTooltip: {fileID: 1511622364}
  mainTooltip: {fileID: 1136642369}
  guidePanel: {fileID: 635445027}
  subtitleGuide: {fileID: 1465890243}
  mainGuide: {fileID: 1263321597}
  displayImage: {fileID: 1536306621}
  closeButton: {fileID: 57852011}
  nextButton: {fileID: 1718297671}
  previousButton: {fileID: 136965798}
  guideSlides:
  - subtitle: '- WELCOME -'
    mainText: 'Welcome to the Matlab Level Editor !

      Here you will be able
      to create and play your own custom level using all the available object in
      the game.

      Let your creativity spread and have fun !'
    displayImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8060b11f477cd9e42af815fe2942a53d, type: 3}
  - subtitle: '- CONTROL -'
    mainText: "While holding right click :\n\t- Move the mouse to rotate around the
      camera\n\t- Use the W/A/S/D/Space/Left Shift key to move\n\nWhile holding left
      click on an object :\n\t- Move the mouse to rotate around the selected object"
    displayImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 36485049293682d4790ac68107b74f96, type: 3}
  - subtitle: '- CONTROL -'
    mainText: "While holding middle click :\n\t- Move the mouse to move the camera
      left/right/up/down\n\nScroll the wheel to go forward/backward"
    displayImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 36485049293682d4790ac68107b74f96, type: 3}
  - subtitle: '- SHORTCUT -'
    mainText: 'Escape (with nothing selected) -> Pause the editor

      Escape (with
      an object selected) -> Deselect object

      Ctrl + S -> Save level

      Ctrl
      + D -> Duplicate selected object

      Ctrl + Z -> Undo

      Ctrl + Y ->
      Redo'
    displayImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 686b480046cdc06448ff2a8d09b79ada, type: 3}
  - subtitle: '- SHORTCUT -'
    mainText: 'In Selection Mode :

      W -> Switch to <color=yellow>Position Gizmo</color>

      E
      -> Switch to <color=yellow>Rotate Gizmo</color>

      R -> Switch to <color=yellow>Scale
      Gizmo</color>

      Del -> Delete selected object'
    displayImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 686b480046cdc06448ff2a8d09b79ada, type: 3}
  - subtitle: '- MODES -'
    mainText: 'Selection mode :

      Allows you to select and modify object on
      the scene


      <color=#B7B700>Interaction mode :</color>

      Allows you
      to select and open the interaction editor for interactable object on the scene'
    displayImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4b6d323730c892341aaeb182a516ea8b, type: 3}
  - subtitle: '- OBJECT -'
    mainText: Object can be placed on the scene and are separated in different categories.
    displayImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 034bd47d32c826243a62675fcabab822, type: 3}
  - subtitle: '- OBJECT -'
    mainText: When placing, object with a scale symbol next to their name can be
      scaled uniformly before placement by maintaining Left Shift and scrolling the
      mouse wheel.
    displayImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b613d2e1465b13949886281fe6afc9cb, type: 3}
  - subtitle: '- BASE OBJECT -'
    mainText: 'Their are always 4 base objects on a level :

      - A base ground
      platform as player needs to stand somewhere

      - The player spawn point

      -
      The end teleporter used to trigger the end of a level

      - A reset button
      in case a player get soft locked on a level


      <color=yellow>Base object
      can''t be deleted as they are necessary !</color>'
    displayImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b59c6f8e1fcbf8942bf5164bba911d15, type: 3}
  - subtitle: '- OBJECT MODIFICATION -'
    mainText: 'Object placed on the scene can be moved, scaled and rotated thanks
      to three mode.


      <color=yellow>Position Gizmo</color> lets you move the
      object

      <color=yellow>Rotate Gizmo</color> lets you rotate some object
      (can be unavailable for some object)

      <color=yellow>Scale Gizmo</color>
      lets you scale some object (can be unavailable for some object)

      Pressing
      Left Shift while scaling scales in place'
    displayImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 93a192970c077b649a96a75e46c52b3d, type: 3}
  - subtitle: '- QUICK TOOLBAR -'
    mainText: The Quick Toolbar gives you usefull tool like recentering and refocusing
      the camera or toggling the grid on and off.
    displayImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ede99737d1a7e0944b4d9137a65ae1b5, type: 3}
  - subtitle: '- QUICK MENU -'
    mainText: The Quick Menu lets you Pause the editor, Save the level and Play test
      it quickly.
    displayImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5946af10470eabd44b534b634f37395a, type: 3}
  - subtitle: '- END NOTES -'
    mainText: 'If you ever forget a control you can check this guide again in the
      pause menu of the editor.

      You can also hover over all th editor button
      to have small tips.


      Now, you have the tool to create your own level
      !

      So get at work to create the next perfect test chamber !'
    displayImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8060b11f477cd9e42af815fe2942a53d, type: 3}
